{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"866171893542551604","content":"\"Do they expect us two to protect Kingsbridge now?\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T06:31:43.723000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868379907737137192","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"866171893542551604","content":"“They… I do not un-der-stand them. But I will… not speak ill of the dead… and we will… if we must”","created_at":"2021-07-24T06:32:29.107000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868380098091434014","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"866171893542551604","content":"\"Do they expect us and their *useless* priestesses charged with their *useless* *meaningless* ***mission*** to do anything like what they were capable of!\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T06:32:47.208000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868380174012522556","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"866171893542551604","content":"Apgan catches himself.","created_at":"2021-07-24T06:33:01.316000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868380233185771520","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"866171893542551604","content":"\"I probably shouldn't speak ill of the dead as well.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T06:33:23.186000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868380324915208202","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"866171893542551604","content":"Nolan frowns. “I am… grate-ful to them. You are re-turned. The one good thing.”","created_at":"2021-07-24T06:33:43.049000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868380408226660402","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"866171893542551604","content":"\"I am afraid,\" Apgan smiles, a little sorrowfully, \"that if I cannot speak ill of the dead, I might have to be silent for a time.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T06:34:35.622000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868380628733808651","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"866171893542551604","content":"“This… we can forge some-thing great… with Will-ow and Ir-ynx… should they for-give me.”","created_at":"2021-07-24T06:34:56.649000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868380716927418440","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"866171893542551604","content":"“Speak good of… what we will do… my friend.”","created_at":"2021-07-24T06:35:31.581000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868380863442862121","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"866171893542551604","content":"\"We will find Buchanan. We will solve the Clutters murder. We will track down Violet. We will hold back the noir.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T06:36:17.864000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868381057567821884","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
