{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"866171893542551604","content":"“Ap-gan… how are you?”","created_at":"2021-07-26T06:17:08.809000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869101013813055549","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"866171893542551604","content":"\"Meditative.\"","created_at":"2021-07-26T06:18:17.765000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869101303035461673","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"866171893542551604","content":"\"We have an opportunity to build a system of justice for the people of Kingsbridge. The rules and power structures aren't laid out for us yet.\"","created_at":"2021-07-26T06:20:13.347000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869101787821527081","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"866171893542551604","content":"\"But that gives us a responsibility.\"","created_at":"2021-07-26T06:21:15.323000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869102047767691294","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"866171893542551604","content":"He nods.","created_at":"2021-07-26T06:22:03.478000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869102249744420875","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"866171893542551604","content":"\"A responsibility I haven't lived up to. But I'm thinking about a code of conduct, an ethic. So that we may know if we have overstepped our bounds. So that the other lamplighters might know, as well.\"","created_at":"2021-07-26T06:23:27.908000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869102603869515786","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"866171893542551604","content":"(Nolan. The Service Revolver is always at your side.)","created_at":"2021-07-26T06:25:09.413000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869103029612335176","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"866171893542551604","content":"XD","created_at":"2021-07-26T06:25:13.319000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869103045995266048","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"866171893542551604","content":"\"Can we compel testimony with zone of truth? Can we violate bodily autonomy in order to track offenders?\"","created_at":"2021-07-26T06:27:44.414000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869103679733653504","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"866171893542551604","content":"\"I have seen these things done, and never questioned them before.\"","created_at":"2021-07-26T06:28:56.542000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869103982260420628","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"866171893542551604","content":"“I would like… due pro-cess. Un… al-i-en-able rights… like in… De-clar-a-tion.”","created_at":"2021-07-26T06:30:46.008000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869104441394085898","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"866171893542551604","content":"\"We have to decide what due process means. It is something we must do with care.\"","created_at":"2021-07-26T06:36:57.406000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869105999150206977","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"866171893542551604","content":"\"To compel testimony from a thief, this feels to me a violation. But are we to let the murderer go for the same reason? Whose liberty are we protecting when we let a murderer free?\"","created_at":"2021-07-26T06:39:06.786000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869106541809266740","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"866171893542551604","content":"“Ev-i-dence. Solid ev-i-dence. Oth-er-wise… how are we bet-ter than those we re-bel against and fight to… pro-tect from?”","created_at":"2021-07-26T06:48:07.813000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-26T06:48:34.188000Z","id":"869108811040964638","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"866171893542551604","content":"“I must… sleep now. Can… we meet to-mor-row in the day…?”","created_at":"2021-07-26T06:50:12.910000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869109335735812147","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
