{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"866171893542551604","content":"\"But I should point out, that your nameless friend is doing something wildly suicidal.\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T04:37:09.515000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869438238815830076","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"866171893542551604","content":"\"What do you mean?\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T04:37:22.093000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869438291571802142","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"866171893542551604","content":"“… He did seem… up-set.”","created_at":"2021-07-27T04:37:44.902000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869438387239665734","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"866171893542551604","content":"\"He walked all the way to my place in Gigglewood Glen. There's cr 32. I mean. There are really strong monsters out there.\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T04:38:24.880000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-27T04:38:38.304000Z","id":"869438554919546910","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"866171893542551604","content":"Willow looks at Irynx.","created_at":"2021-07-27T04:39:26.820000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869438814714724362","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"866171893542551604","content":"\"You want to go stop him?\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T04:39:38.975000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869438865696509962","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"866171893542551604","content":"\"I got him back. He's being all dark and broody.\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T04:40:32.204000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869439088955125811","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"866171893542551604","content":"\"I don't know what those numbers mean but well, not very surprised about the monsters.\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T04:40:46.879000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869439150506520636","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"866171893542551604","content":"\"Maybe he's trying to prove a point because I called him weak.\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T04:40:59.805000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869439204722085889","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"866171893542551604","content":"“What did… he see… that up-set him so.”","created_at":"2021-07-27T04:41:08.728000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869439242147876875","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"866171893542551604","content":"\"Oh, thats how we measure strength where I come from, out beyond the 4th wall.\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T04:41:12.893000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869439259617132584","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"866171893542551604","content":"“He seemed… hurt.”","created_at":"2021-07-27T04:41:19.750000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869439288377499698","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"866171893542551604","content":"\"Most places have four walls.\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T04:41:31.619000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869439338159681536","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"866171893542551604","content":"\"He is hurt. So hurt he was calling to me with out even knowing it.\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T04:42:00.781000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869439460473966652","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"866171893542551604","content":"\"I don't really like being around people when they're... beyond upset. A little bit bad, maybe I can still pull them back. Anything past that bothers me. It's a job for Hope.\" She taps Ed on the nose.","created_at":"2021-07-27T04:43:30.280000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869439835860008982","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"866171893542551604","content":"\"You all smell like the same place. So I thought I'd come tell you. I was trying to bring him to you. But he dipped. I mean he wandered off when we got close.\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T04:43:39.841000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869439875961716777","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"866171893542551604","content":"She smiles.","created_at":"2021-07-27T04:43:54.088000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869439935717978114","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"866171893542551604","content":"\"I don't think he likes us very much.\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T04:44:24.116000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869440061664559114","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"866171893542551604","content":"\"People who don't like themselves after they made a big mistake can seem like that.\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T04:44:49.351000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869440167507796010","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"866171893542551604","content":"“He’s up-set. For sure. Took it out on you, may-be. But he cares for Ir-ynx at the least.”","created_at":"2021-07-27T04:45:23.432000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869440310453866536","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"866171893542551604","content":"\"He's worth it. I got a nose for these things.\" She boops Nolan's nose.","created_at":"2021-07-27T04:46:14.254000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869440523616792628","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"866171893542551604","content":"\"Ok. I love you. Bye bye.\" she flits off into the Noir.","created_at":"2021-07-27T04:46:39.586000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869440629866889286","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
